# DEEP 10-24 settings
story sample|Heart sample|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|A sealed tube of gold pollen from the Heart's first bloom, from the sunk lab van.
story vault|Vault sealed|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|The first-bloom sample is sealed in the Seedkeepers' vault.
prop seedvault obj.name=seedvault
prop seedvault beh.use=Seal the sample in the seed vault
prop seedvault if.use=!signal|vault\ntake|story:sample|1
prop seedvault on.use=signal||vault\ngive||story:vault*1\nshow|vaultchest\nmessage||The vault takes the tube, hisses and seals. A drawer slides out beside it: the vault ledger.
prop seedvault else.use=message||The Seedkeepers' seed vault. A slot for one sample tube, empty. The pollen watch box says to bring the sample here.
prop vaultchest obj.name=vaultchest
prop vaultchest beh.hidden=1
note vaultchest Vault ledger | SEED VAULT - VERDANCE\n\nKept back: one of every seed we had before the growth.\nKept back: the first bloom, sealed, so whoever comes after can see what we made.\nIf the Heart is burnt, plant these. If it is spread, these are what the land was.\n\n(In the margin, Marit: "The gate is open. The Rootcore is under us - the oldest root, band 400. Teodor is down there. Oda went in after him. Go carefully, and bring my sister back up.")
loot vaultchest Seed_Flower_Yellow*2;Seed_Pine*2;TitaniumOre*1
prop vaultchest loot.refill=0
quest title=The Heart
quest intro=The Heart of Green, at the centre of Verdance. Make for the giant Heart tree, then find the trunk door at its foot.
