step collect|story:sample|1|Dive to the lab van off the old road and take the sample from its fridge
step collect|story:vault|1|Seal the sample in the seed vault box on the slope
step read|Vault ledger|1|Read the vault ledger
quest done=The gate is open. Below the Heart: the Rootcore - band 400.
quest reward=Seed_Flower_Yellow*2;TitaniumOre*1

